# held/props/clappers: a pair of wooden clappers for the Drum posture's Wood variant (PROPS, P2b), one slab in each hand,
# apart (hold) and clapped together at the chest (pray). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h. Anchored on the right shoulder.
use person
legend V linen 0
legend W linen 1
legend X linen 2
legend Y linen 3
legend Z linen 4
legend Q cloth3 0
legend R cloth3 1
legend S cloth3 2
legend T cloth3 3
legend U cloth3 4
legend I metal2 0
legend J metal2 4
body man woman
role held clappers
anchor shoulderR
keys held
z 40

